From 095789db0be8b7f1b32299bfda4c96171caa7053 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hank Yeomans <hank@quorra.ah.local>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:25:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 28/61] kt runtime: runner-owned kt state (KtRuntime), explicit
 CompactMXFP4Loader, no module registry (recipe T3.19c)

- new layers/moe/kt_runtime.py: KtRuntime per ModelRunner owns providers,
  leases, ForwardLedger, prefill coordinator slot, timeline, side streams;
  reserve_capture_sizes; load_cpu_experts installs a CompactMXFP4Loader
  into kt's NativeMoEWrapper loader slot per layer and asserts kt used it
  (kt's constructor-made plain loader is released; a stale compact loader
  is refused). Scoped activate()/current() handle around load_model only.
- new layers/moe/kt_loader.py: CompactMXFP4Loader subclass replaces the
  process-wide load_experts monkey-patch and the _KT_LOADER_GPU_MASK global.
- kt_provider.py: module registry removed; KtKernelProvider takes
  ledger=/leases=. kt_timeline.py: _TIMELINE/get_timeline removed.
- kt_ep_wrapper.py: coordinator via KTConfig.runtime; _B2_STREAMS removed
  (runtime.side_stream); loader patch block deleted.
- model_runner / cuda_graph_setup / decode_cuda_graph_runner /
  breakable_cuda_graph_backend read model_runner.kt_runtime.

Gate (recipe evidence/t319/c): NLL bit-identical vs T3.28 corpus
(0/65,653 moved), consistency PASS, C1 41.56/39.58 wall, C4 56.05/53.85,
prefill 16K 1,471 tok/s, 0 health hits, EDAC 0/0.

